<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If you would like to know this place</l><l>Where you’ll find abundant grace,</l><l>All that I can say is that you’ll have to “see.”</l><l>’Cause words come short of the appeal—</l><l>I just know that it is real—</l><l>Once you’ve seen it too, I think that you’ll agree!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
